diagonal: the producer stays virtual: true
diagonal: no buffer read of the producer survives: true
diagonal: exactly one scratch, 1-D of the reader's extent: true
diagonal: the scratch is written by the prologue and read by the consumer: true
diagonal: the prologue instantiates the reduction (a loop of the reduction extent survives): true
diagonal: both lattice neighbours are offered as flips: true
diagonal: the footprint form is not offered where it is already chosen: true
diagonal: the inlined arm really inlines (no scratch): true
diagonal: executed values are the diagonal of the reduction: true
diagonal: footprint and materialized arms agree: true
diagonal: footprint and inlined arms agree: true
visit-cap: the producer stays virtual: true
visit-cap: one 1-D scratch over the reader's outer loop: true
visit-cap: executed values are the diagonal broadcast plus the column: true
visit-cap: footprint and materialized arms agree: true
full: the reduction cap materializes the producer: true
full: no scratch: true
full: the inline flip is offered, the footprint flip is not (as many cells as the node): true
full: executed values are the reduction: true
full-preferred: the producer stays virtual: true
full-preferred: one 2-D scratch over the reader's box: true
full-preferred: footprint and materialized arms agree: true
guarded: the reduction cap materializes the producer: true
guarded: no scratch: true
guarded: the footprint flip is not offered: true
guarded: executed values respect the guard: true
preference: the default inlines the producer (no buffer read): true
preference: the default mints no scratch: true
preference: the preference lands the producer on the footprint form: true
preference: executed values are the diagonal: true
preference: footprint and inlined arms agree: true
inherited: the producer routine commits the node virtual with an empty schedule: true
inherited: the consumer footprint-scopes the inherited node: true
inherited: executed values are the diagonal of the inherited reduction: true
inherited-guarded: the read declines to inlining (no buffer read): true
inherited-guarded: no scratch: true
inherited-guarded: executed values respect the guard: true
single-cell: the producer stays virtual: true
single-cell: one single-cell scratch: true
single-cell: executed values are the corner cell plus the column: true
single-cell: footprint and materialized arms agree: true
two-readers: the producer stays virtual: true
two-readers: one scratch per reader: true
two-readers: executed values are the diagonal and the column: true
two-readers: footprint and materialized arms agree: true
candidate-consumer: the decision retracts to the reduction cap: true
candidate-consumer: no scratch: true
candidate-consumer: the intermediate consumer inlines: true
candidate-consumer: the retracted node is not offered the footprint flip: true
candidate-consumer: executed values are the diagonal: true
shared-loop: the reduction cap materializes the producer: true
shared-loop: no scratch: true
shared-loop: executed values are the diagonal and the copy: true
key-off: the reduction cap materializes the producer: true
key-off: no scratch: true
key-off: no footprint flip: true
key-off: executed values are the diagonal: true
intervening: the producer stays virtual: true
intervening: one 1-D scratch: true
intervening: the prologue runs at the producer's position, ahead of the rewrite: true
intervening: the scratch holds the reduction over the input as it was at the producer: true
intervening: footprint and materialized arms agree: true
between-setters: the reduction cap materializes the producer: true
between-setters: no scratch: true
between-setters: executed values are the zero-init the reader finds: true
recurrence: the producer routine leaves the node virtual: true
recurrence: the reader writes a template leaf, so no scratch: true
recurrence: the read is inlined: true
recurrence: executed values read the pre-write cell, as inlining does: true
inherited-operand: the producer routine leaves the node virtual: true
inherited-operand: the consumer footprint-scopes the inherited node: true
inherited-operand: executed values are the diagonal over the operand: true
shared-producer: the reduction cap materializes the producer: true
shared-producer: no scratch: true
shared-producer: executed values read the input as the producer did: true
between-components: the reduction cap materializes the producer: true
between-components: no scratch: true
between-components: executed values fold the old input, then the new: true
rejection: the mismatched read commits the producer materialized: true
rejection: the stranded prologue is a gather of the buffer (three buffer reads, no scope): true
rejection: executed values are the column and the untouched zeros: true
rejection: footprint and materialized arms agree: true
